   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Graphic contrast: median ~102, deep blacks (p1 ~3) and bright whites (p99 ~242), neutral shadows (28,25,25), bright highlights (224,220,215), balanced hue mix, low saturation (0.22). Best for: Architecture and people, hard shadows and lines, minimal frames, graphic venue details, modern city pre-weddings. Contrast first, colour second.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
